Let counter be 1.
While the value of counter is less than or equal to 15,
    If the value of counter remainder 15 is equal to 0,
        Say FizzBuzz.
    Otherwise if the value of counter remainder 3 is equal to 0,
        Say Fizz.
    Otherwise if the value of counter remainder 5 is equal to 0,
        Say Buzz.
    Otherwise,
        Say the value of counter.
    End if.
    Add 1 to counter.
End while.
